    <guid isPermaLink="false">67278aa7cbe0e69c8bcc4adf</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello早安！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是9月10月的kpop新闻+新歌速递，9月是newjeans用一场直播创飞kpop，10月各路女团开始为年底的KPI疯狂上班。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着年末的到来，大家在上网冲浪之余要注意保重身体，干什么都没有身体重要！</span></p><span></span><h2><em><span>*本期内容非常主观，纯纯是姐妹群聊天八卦闲聊，没有任何拉踩吵架的意思。</span></em></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：江子、斯黛拉、老妮</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期详情：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a> SM公司30周年庆 - 回顾公司历程，视角聚焦粉丝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">3:21</a> new Jeans相关- 为制作人发声，引发争议讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 国会哭诉职场霸凌事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a>方敏大战进展 - 闵熙珍要求职位，影响团规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> Riize相关事件 - 洪胜汉回归引争议，三进三退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a> Jessi事件 - 保同行人打人，Jessi形象受损</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 田小娟 - 据报道不续约cube</span></p><span></span><p><span>·新歌速递：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> BLACKPIN Jennie和rose的新歌情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2957">49:17</a> ITZY专辑评价 - 对一级新专辑表示失望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> Kiss of life回归 - 新专辑风评不如前，将巡演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> Say my name出道 - 介绍金在中女团，观望其发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3204">53:24</a> Aespa回归专辑 &nbsp;- 抽我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3467">57:47</a> illit回归 - MV拖后腿，歌曲ok</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3672">1:01:12</a> PUROLE KISS回归 - 万圣节专属女团，风格独特新颖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">1:02:03</a> 曹璐专辑 - 自费出专辑，努力令人赞赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待年末舞台</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《APT》- Rose（feat brunomars）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Bubble gum》- Neawjeans</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Stand by u》-东方神起</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Siren》- Riize</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Zoom》- Jessi</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mantra》 - Jennie</span></p><span></span><p><span>《runaway baby》 - Bruno mars</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Trên Tình Bạn Dưới Tình Yêu》 - 阮明杏</span></p><span></span><p><span>《GOLD》 - ITZY</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Supernatural》 - ITZY</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Whiplash》 - AESPA</span></p><span></span><p><span>《360》 - Charli XCX</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Up》 - 柳智敏karina</span></p><span></span><p><span>《On my bike》 - Purple Kiss</span></p><span></span><p><span>《可怜(You're pitiful)》 - Fiestar （中文版）</span></p>]]></description>
