  <item>
    <title>Vol.81 暑期档过时影评 | 从《姥姥的外孙》谈谈东亚家庭的温情与压迫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67151a59db2cf827579c0ddd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67151a59db2cf827579c0ddd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Oct 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>拖了很久的暑期档+中秋档过时影评来喽</span></p><span></span><p><span>属实是为了《里斯本丸沉默》录了一期播客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们按照本人喜好分成了三档</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨超好评档：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 《姥姥的外孙》震撼的写实、东亚家庭的感同身受、关于“儿子继承房子、女儿继承癌症”的大讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">24:26</a>《里斯本丸沉默》这是属于理想主义者的胜利，本年度在电影院看到的最好的爱情故事和笑话</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏有争议档</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>《抓娃娃》GET不到开心麻花的笑点，但觉得电影立意很不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a>《从二十一世纪安全撤离》很爱作者的独特导演性！但无法理解男人的青春期生长痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a>《解密》很花钱的大片但！？陈思诚与刘昊然一次失败的尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a>《狗阵》男性视角过多但电影需要多种类型片！彭于晏表演很有突破</span></p><span></span><p><span>😫评分比较低档：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">1:03</a>《异人之下》乌尔善你怎么这么歹毒！全方位对我进行伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">1:13</a>《负负得正》爱情片真的不吃香吗？？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">1:21</a>感慨一下很poor的王俊凯</span></p><span></span><p><span></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq0VRiuU-LTEP55zJDIcZacio1Cc.m4a" length="83970322" type="audio/mp4"/>
