    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HI 大家!</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋爱兄妹还有最后4期（居然，离开首尔的五组手足前往新加坡开新副本，没想到原本稳定的12和24都出现了裂横，51开始上大分，还有一组稳稳地幸福。虽然节目的收视率低迷，但我们三位还是针对嘉宾的表现，展开了大讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>申明：仅为主播们的主观看法。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：江子、斯黛拉、老妮</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容详情：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">4:46</a> 女五金智媛初登场就预示了她的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 51上大分——节目组早就铺垫了嗑点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 朱妍对宰亨的行为有点“漠视忽略双方的感受”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 家庭没有满足她太多的情感需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">29:16</a> 世晟和正燮的cp张力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">34:26</a> 龙宇风评逆转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> “回避型依赖”——在</span><strong><span>被爱的渴望与被抛弃的恐惧来回拉扯</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">49:36</a> </span></strong><span>允在身上的东亚男性的普遍缺点</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Jason marz-《unlonely》</span></p><span></span><p><span>冰球乐队-《能不能和我留在台北》</span></p>]]></description>
