    <guid isPermaLink="false">663dbf5daf6f88d32f8c8132</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是4月kpop新闻汇总，江子、鸭子、斯黛拉和老妮针对hybe的大斗特斗后引发的事件来了大讨论，一开始我们都默认是hybe的又一次营销，盘完感觉最受伤的应该是newjeans。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4月，五代也出现了小火但是解散的团体，也有忽然离世的歌手，祝大家都能有健康的身体和灵魂，活着才有希望！加油！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容详情：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">1:19</a> TWICE孙彩英和Zion.T官宣恋爱；志效《租房者》妆造引发争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> SHINE成员Key和珉豪与SM续约，宣布5月举办4人演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 4月12日，朴宝蓝意外去世享年30岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> cherrybullet宣布解散；Kepler宣布组合活动不延长，将于7月解散</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> Lesserafim初次登场科切拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> HYBE内斗，fiftyfifty2.0？闵珍熙和方时赫的办公室争斗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a> 4月回归艺人汇总</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> NCTDREAM黄仁俊因健康问题缺席梦秀3</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Impossible》- &nbsp;RIIZE</span></p><span></span><p><span>《惠化洞》- 朴宝蓝</span></p><span></span><p><span>《bubble gum》-Newjeans</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Violet》- Cherry bullet</span></p>]]></description>
