    <title>VOL.72 KPOP311事变/韩素希柳俊烈李惠利换乘恋爱/HYBE新女团出道叕登顶啦！本月没有好作品全是烂八卦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660f506fc891c06e735c049e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660f506fc891c06e735c049e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 05:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HI 大家</span></p><span></span><p><span>假期快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是韩娱time，3月份咱们男女爱豆都忙着完成恋爱的KPI。内娱无聊的当下，咱们乐子人真的缺不了隔壁韩娱。本期依旧全是主观，包括ILLIT到底是没有内核还是路人太严格，地租回归的容貌管理不合格等言论，申明！以上皆为主播们的个人观点。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>非常感谢</span><em><strong><span>朱赭对上期节目的</span></strong></em><span>打赏，我们会继续努力！</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：江子、斯黛拉、老妮</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容详情：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">5:05</a> 3月11日 kpop捡男爱豆差点大塌房之捡手机事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> Riize撤回第一版应援棒，并把团名改为更名为CtrlZ（bushi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 4月2日柳智敏交往四周后宣布分手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> 3月15日韩素希柳俊烈李惠利，换乘恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 李惠利和泰妍合作综艺和challenge</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> Hybe新女团illit出道，出道即各种登顶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a> Svt即将开启首尔演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a> NCTdream回归之虐粉套路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2795">46:35</a> 厉旭宣布结婚；志效恋上丑男；jyp在内蒙古被网友喊话：不要骑马了！；黄旭熙solo打歌，nct纷纷受害。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《My Crush》 - Muque</span></p><span></span><p><span>《MAMA》- EXO</span></p><span></span><p><span>《第三者》 - 梁静茹</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Unknown》- NCT Dream</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Magnetic》 - ILLIT&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
